<mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
